usage: verify_knight_variable_monitor_run.py [-h] --begin BEGIN
                                             --finish FINISH
                                             --causal-projection CAUSAL_PROJECTION
                                             --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR

Verify original begin/finish monitor receipts against a same-run save
projection. Reads only existing local evidence. Creates a new output directory
and exact copies, never calls CK3, a provider, desktop, transport or network
operations.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --begin BEGIN
  --finish FINISH
  --causal-projection CAUSAL_PROJECTION
  --output-dir OUTPUT_DIR
